# rox patch: user shader primitive (WT-S2).
#
# Adds Window::register_user_shader / paint_user_shader and the in-scene
# UserShader primitive that draws through a runtime-compiled blade pipeline,
# and rebases the post-process pass onto the same registry. Blade only: the
# Metal and D3D renderers skip the batch the way blade skips surfaces off mac.
# macOS is meant to ride the macos-blade feature rather than a Metal port.
#
# Applies on top of post-process-pass.patch.
